# Local development environment variables (used by `wrangler dev` only)
# Usage: copy this file to .dev.vars and adjust it as needed (.dev.vars is excluded by .gitignore)
# For production use: npx wrangler secret put <NAME>
#
# 本地开发环境变量 (仅 wrangler dev 使用)
# 用法: 复制为 .dev.vars 后按需修改 (.dev.vars 已被 .gitignore 排除)
# 生产环境请使用: npx wrangler secret put <名称>
JWT_SECRET=dev-secret-change-me

# Password-hash pepper (optional, strongly recommended)
# Once set, new passwords and password changes are stored as PBKDF2-SHA256 + random salt + pepper; old
# triple-MD5 hashes can still log in and are upgraded automatically on the next successful login.
# ⚠️ Never change or remove it once set: old hashes can no longer be verified afterwards
# (the server returns an explicit 1009 instead of "wrong password"), so restore the original value.
#
# 密码哈希 pepper (可选, 强烈建议配置)
# 配置后新密码/改密会使用 PBKDF2-SHA256 + 随机盐 + pepper; 旧的三重 MD5 哈希仍可登录,
# 并在登录成功后自动升级。⚠️ 一旦配置就不要随意更换: 换了之后旧哈希无法校验
# (服务端会返回明确的 1009 提示而不是「密码错误」), 需要恢复原有值。
# PASSWORD_PEPPER=please-change-me

# PBKDF2 iteration count (optional, default 5000 ≈ 2.6 ms CPU)
# The Workers free plan allows 10 ms CPU per request, so a much larger value makes login fail with 1102;
# after upgrading to Workers Paid it can be raised to 210000.
#
# PBKDF2 迭代数 (可选, 默认 5000 ≈ 2.6ms CPU)
# Workers 免费版每请求 CPU 上限 10ms, 设太大登录会报 1102; 升级到 Paid 后可调到 210000。
# PASSWORD_PBKDF2_ITERATIONS=5000
